Database migrations (Alembic, via Flask-Migrate).

  flask create-db                      apply all pending migrations (also run by the Docker entrypoint)
  flask db migrate -m "Describe it"    after changing backend/models.py, generate a new migration
  flask db upgrade / flask db downgrade

Review every generated file before committing: Alembic cannot detect renames
and may miss some type changes. tests/test_migrations.py fails if the models
and the migrations ever describe different schemas.
